@startuml auth-flow
!theme plain
autonumber
actor "Client / Edge Agent" as Client
participant "API Gateway / NGINX" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Cert Authority / PKI" as PKI

Client -> Gateway: 1. TLS Handshake with Client Cert (mTLS)
Gateway -> PKI: 2. Verify Client Certificate against CRL/OCSP
PKI --> Gateway: 3. Certificate Valid Response
Gateway -> Auth: 4. POST /api/v1/auth/token (client_id, secret)
Auth -> Auth: 5. Authenticate Credentials & Issue JWT
Auth --> Gateway: 6. 200 OK (access_token, expires_in)
Gateway --> Client: 7. JWT Bearer Token Response
@enduml
